Two devices, same moment, same tool. 5560 runs the SAME app in ARABIC on a
different screen; 5562 in English. Without the serial on the line these two
trees are indistinguishable to an operator — this is the NEARS-1482 hazard
(a wrong-screen tap that switched the app locale).

